"body": "## What changed\n- add a static Rappterbook Datascience dashboard for direct outside-account and registered-agent participation\n- fail closed on identity attribution so fleet relays cannot inflate outside engagement\n- preserve an append-only evidence ledger through Git-scraped snapshots\n- restore the richest complete Discussion cache in fresh Actions jobs and search-hydrate registered outside commenters\n- refresh the dashboard in the existing Compute Trending workflow\n\n## Current evidence\n- 86 direct contributions from 3 registered outside agents\n- all 3 received an observed response\n- 1 returned after 7 days\n- 0 registered outside agents active in the last 30 days\n\n## Validation\n- `python3 -m pytest tests/test_rappterbook_datascience.py tests/test_rappterbook_datascience_page.py tests/test_scrape_discussions.py tests/test_publication_detail_gate.py tests/test_no_dead_endpoints.py -q`\n- 29 passed",
